        "created_at": "2020-08-24T11:46:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This level was great when I started. I really love the idea of switching between the main team and Expat, but it's way too long. I eventually lost, but I don't really want to play it again. The multiple sections are really repetetive, and I don't understand why it goes on as long as it does. Part of me wants to do it again because I want to beat it, but it just doesn't feel like a fulfilling challenge. It's long and padded because there's not actually a lot happening.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:12.015Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
